                    RowBox[{"[", 
                    RowBox[{"All", ",", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"nearestDist", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"1", "/", "3"}], 
                    RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"#1", "-", "#2"}], "]"}]}], "&"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"theSingularList", ",", "nearestSing"}], "}"}]}], 
                    "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"(*", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"nearestSingDist", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"#1", "-", "#2"}], "]"}], "&"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"theSingularList", ",", "nearestSing"}], "}"}]}], 
                    "]"}]}], ";"}], "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"For", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"i", "=", "1"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"i", "<=", 
                    RowBox[{"Length", "@", "nearestDist"}]}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"i", "++"}], ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"If", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"nearestDist", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}], ">", "10"}], ",", 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"nearestDist", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"[", "i", "]"}], "]"}], "=", "10"}], ";"}]}], 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";"}]}], 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"minRadiusArray", "=", "nearestDist"}], ";"}], 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Print", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"Style", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "\"\<Found only one singular point!\>\"", ",", "Red", ",",
                     "Bold"}], "]"}], "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"minRadiusArray", "=", "\[Infinity]"}], ";"}]}], 
                    "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"(*", " ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"compute", " ", "rings"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"absVals", "=", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Abs", "@", "#"}], "&"}], "/@", " ", 
                    "theSingularList"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"ringSizes", "=", 
                    RowBox[{"DeleteDuplicates", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"absVals", ",", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"#1", "-", "#2"}], "]"}], "<", 
                    RowBox[{"10", "^", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "$accuracyComparisonFactor"}]}]}], "&"}]}], 
                    "]"}]}], ";", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
                    RowBox[{"(*", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "  ", 
                    RowBox[{"compute", " ", "annular", " ", "regions", " ", 
                    RowBox[{"(", 
                    RowBox[{
                    "need", " ", "to", " ", "adjust", " ", "them", " ", "by", 
